{"id":"sh/ba9gnux8","text":"Full replenishment removes free initial-energy credit.","position":{"left":78,"top":78,"width":1120,"height":108},"style":{"fontSize":42,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#102B36","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"id":"tb/xwbm9cf6","text":"Physical ingredient\tDeclared value\nServices A, B\t[0,1] and [2,3], each uses 15 kWh\nBattery and vehicle fee\t20 kWh, fee 7 per used bus\nEarly / terminal charging\t[1,2] at 10 kW / [3,4] at 30 kW\nInventory and fleet\tStart full, end full, at most two buses","position":{"left":80,"top":208,"width":1120,"height":310}}
{"id":"sh/p8rylkf2","text":"Every feasible fleet purchases 30 kWh. The choice is timing and fleet structure, not unpaid depletion.","position":{"left":80,"top":576,"width":1120,"height":95},"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#315A63","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
