{"id":"sh/6xs3a9gv","text":"The qualifications","position":{"left":655,"top":205,"width":520,"height":70},"style":{"fontSize":28,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#315A63","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"id":"sh/7y14jexg","text":"Use the same complete-plan set, compactness and attained dual prices. With nonsmooth supply, consider all admissible prices.","position":{"left":655,"top":290,"width":520,"height":250},"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#102B36","alignment":"left"}}
{"id":"sh/kval8zyp","text":"The general convex-duality mechanism is established theory. Our claim must be the specific physical result.","position":{"left":80,"top":576,"width":1120,"height":95},"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#315A63","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
