{"id":"sh/gza1gnul","text":"A small aggregate gap can coexist with a whole-owner incentive.","position":{"left":78,"top":78,"width":1120,"height":108},"style":{"fontSize":42,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#102B36","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"id":"tb/0fml83a5","text":"Replication in the manuscript\tAs the number of service pairs n grows\nPhysical–hull gap\tAt most 5/n, hence vanishes\nWhole-owner absolute regret\tTends to 351/40 along n = 40k + 1\nOne owner per pair, reserved resources\tEach regret at most 20/n, hence vanishes","position":{"left":80,"top":208,"width":1120,"height":310}}
{"id":"sh/uxsjexcf","text":"Who may coordinate a deviation matters. Per-bus and relative whole-owner regret still vanish in this family.","position":{"left":80,"top":576,"width":1120,"height":95},"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#315A63","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
